OL,3,GNEWSAFour treated at scene after car
OL,4,Acrashes into verge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been treated at the
OL,7,Fscene of a crash on the M25 after a car
OL,8,Fcrashed into a verge by the M23 slip
OL,9,Froad, Surrey Police said.
OL,11,FA grey Toyota crashed shortly after
OL,12,F09:50 BST as it left Junction 7
OL,13,Fanticlockwise, near Merstham, according
OL,14,Fto the force.
OL,16,FA spokesperson said the force was
OL,17,Fappealing for witnesses and was looking
OL,18,Ffor anyone who "might have witnessed
OL,19,Fthe manner of driving of the vehicle".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
