OL,3,GNEWSAFour treated at scene after car
OL,4,Acrashes into verge
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are particularly interested in
OL,7,Fdashcam or helmet cam footage that may
OL,8,Fhave captured all or part of the
OL,9,Fcollision and the moments leading up to
OL,10,Fit," they added.
